Inorder to go to the 70th line the command used was ":70"
To insert the given line into the 70th line the command used was "i" to get into insert mode.
The given line is entered into 70th line.
exit into normal mode by striking 'Esc' (escape).
Inorder to change the word 'important' to 'critical', the following command was used - " :s/important/critical ".
entering the command provides the output where in the line, the word 'important' is replaced by the new word 'critical'.

